{
  "structure": {
    "lists": [
      {
        "tag": "ul",
        "className": "",
        "start": null,
        "items": [
          "GoogleCloudのコンテナデプロイに初めて触れるソフトウェアエンジニア/QAエンジニア",
          "ArtifactRegistry・CloudBuild・BinaryAuthorizationを「使ったことはあるが、なぜそう設定するのか」を理解したい方",
          "ソフトウェアサプライチェーンセキュリティ（SLSA、脆弱性スキャン、イメージ署名）の実践的な考え方を学びたい方"
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "ol",
        "className": "",
        "start": null,
        "items": [
          "コンテナイメージを「検証前」と「検証後」で分離管理する設計思想を理解する",
          "CloudBuildを使ったビルド→スキャン→署名→デプロイの自動化パイプラインを構築できる",
          "BinaryAuthorizationのAttestor・Note・Attestation・Policyの関係を説明できる",
          "脆弱性スキャン結果をCI/CDのゲート（品質関門）として使う理由と実装方法を理解する",
          "実際にビルドが失敗した際、どう調査し、修正し、再実行するかのフローを体得する"
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "ul",
        "className": "",
        "start": null,
        "items": [
          "必要なAPI（CloudKMS、CloudRun、CloudBuild、GKE、ContainerRegistry、ArtifactRegistry、ContainerScanning、On-DemandScanning、BinaryAuthorization）を有効化する",
          "サンプルアプリのソース一式を取得する",
          "artifact-scanning-repo（スキャン用）とartifact-prod-repo（本番用）の2つのDockerリポジトリを作成する"
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "ul",
        "className": "",
        "start": null,
        "items": [
          "CloudBuildのサービスアカウントにroles/iam.serviceAccountUserとroles/ondemandscanning.adminを付与する",
          "cloudbuild.yamlのイメージ名プレースホルダーを埋める（artifact-scanning-repo/sample-image）",
          "ビルドを実行し、スキャン結果にCRITICAL脆弱性があることを確認する"
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "ul",
        "className": "",
        "start": null,
        "items": [
          "Dockerfileのベースイメージをpython:3.8-alpineに変更",
          "Flask3.0.3/Gunicorn23.0.0/Werkzeug3.0.4へ依存パッケージを更新",
          "パイプラインを再実行し、成功を確認",
          "検証目的でallUsersにroles/run.invokerを付与し、動作確認"
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "ol",
        "className": "reference-list",
        "start": null,
        "items": [
          "01BinaryAuthorizationoverviewdocs.cloud.google.com/binary-authorization/docs/overview",
          "02BinaryAuthorizationconceptsdocs.cloud.google.com/binary-authorization/docs/key-concepts",
          "03Attestationsoverview|BinaryAuthorizationdocs.cloud.google.com/binary-authorization/docs/attestations",
          "04Createattestations|BinaryAuthorizationdocs.cloud.google.com/binary-authorization/docs/making-attestations",
          "05CreateaBinaryAuthorizationattestationinaCloudBuildpipelinedocs.cloud.google.com/binary-authorization/docs/cloud-build",
          "06cloud-builders-community:binauthz-attestation(GitHub)github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-builders-community",
          "07SetupoverviewforCloudRun|BinaryAuthorizationdocs.cloud.google.com/binary-authorization/docs/run/overview",
          "08EnableBinaryAuthorizationforCloudRundocs.cloud.google.com/binary-authorization/docs/run/enabling-binauthz-cloud-run",
          "09Quickstart:ConfigureaBinaryAuthorizationpolicywithCloudRundocs.cloud.google.com/binary-authorization/docs/run/configure-policy-cloud-run",
          "10Artifactanalysisandvulnerabilityscanning|ArtifactRegistrydocs.cloud.google.com/artifact-registry/docs/analysis",
          "11Containerscanningoverview|ArtifactAnalysisdocs.cloud.google.com/artifact-analysis/docs/container-scanning-overview",
          "12UseOn-DemandScanninginyourCloudBuildpipelinedocs.cloud.google.com/artifact-analysis/docs/ods-cloudbuild",
          "13gcloudartifactsdockerimagesscanリファレンスcloud.google.com/sdk/gcloud/reference/artifacts/docker/images/scan",
          "14Createstandardrepositories|ArtifactRegistrydocs.cloud.google.com/artifact-registry/docs/repositories/create-repos",
          "15Quickstart:StoreDockercontainerimagesinArtifactRegistrydocs.cloud.google.com/artifact-registry/docs/docker/store-docker-container-images",
          "16Createakey|CloudKeyManagementServicedocs.cloud.google.com/kms/docs/create-key",
          "17Creatingandvalidatingdigitalsignatures|CloudKMSdocs.cloud.google.com/kms/docs/create-validate-signatures",
          "18IAMrolesandpermissions|CloudBuilddocs.cloud.google.com/build/docs/iam-roles-permissions",
          "19ConfigureaccessforthedefaultCloudBuildserviceaccountdocs.cloud.google.com/build/docs/securing-builds/set-service-account-permissions",
          "20gcloudrundeployリファレンスdocs.cloud.google.com/sdk/gcloud/reference/run/deploy",
